---
import Main from "../../layouts/Main.astro";
---

<Main
  title="About - SyncID Labs"
  description="A venture-studio pioneer since 2013, SyncID Labs has spent a decade inside the Canadian innovation gap. We build, we do not forecast."
  lang="en"
  activePath="/about"
>
  <section class="border-b border-neutral-200">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-neutral-900">Who we are</h1>

      <div class="mt-10 space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
        <p>
          SyncID Labs, Synchronous Incubation and Development Labs, has operated on the
          venture-studio model since 2013, before the term existed. We have spent a decade inside
          the Canadian innovation gap, and we know why founders leave, why IP is lost, and why
          districts fail.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our credibility is grounded: doctoral work under review at the University of Waterloo and
          the University of Calgary; a network across the University of Toronto, Toronto
          Metropolitan University, and the venture ecosystem; venture exits of $70M and $650M.
        </p>
        <p>
          We do not forecast Canada's future. We build it, venture by venture, on land in Markham.
        </p>
        <p>
          SyncID Labs is the operational, build-oriented member of a wider constellation. FW.VISION
          provides the governance and futures research; SyncID actualizes.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Main>
